	"data": "Star OS — Skill Tree Plan\n\nVision Recap\n\nStar OS is an XR-native operating system where the 3D spatial layer IS the desktop. Linux kernel handles hardware. A custom spatial compositor replaces the 2D desktop. Core manages spatial services. ThoughtBubbles is the filesystem. Godot renders directly to DRM/KMS. OpenXR handles input/display. Visual services replace terminal daemons.\n\nThis is not an XR app on top of Linux. It's an OS where spatial computing is the native paradigm.\n\nDomain…",
